@baseUrl = https://localhost:7097

### Check that the AutoBodyService API is available
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Check the ProblemDetails response for an unknown route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/unknown

### Obtain antiforgery cookies; copy XSRF-TOKEN into the header below.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/antiforgery

### Register a customer (supply locally generated test values and antiforgery token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "name": "{{testName}}",
  "phone": "{{testPhone}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Login; refresh the antiforgery token after authentication.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "phone": "{{testPhone}}",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Current account (requires authentication cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### Logout (requires authentication cookie and a fresh antiforgery token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

### Own profile (requires authentication cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile

### Change only your name (requires a fresh antiforgery token)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "name": "{{testName}}"
}

### Change your password (use locally supplied credentials; refresh antiforgery token first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "currentPassword": "{{testPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newTestPassword}}"
}

### Public contacts (only configured public fields are returned)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/contacts

### Weekly inspection hours (Admin or SuperAdmin cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/inspection-schedule

### Replace weekly hours after preview; copy version and confirmation token and refresh antiforgery.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/inspection-schedule
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "version": "{{scheduleVersion}}",
  "confirmationToken": "{{confirmationToken}}",
  "intervals": [
    { "dayOfWeek": "Monday", "start": "09:00", "end": "12:00" }
  ]
}

### Inspection exception and effective template for a local date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/inspection-exceptions?date=2026-11-09

### Replace one date rule after preview; copy version and confirmation token and refresh antiforgery.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/inspection-exceptions
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "version": "{{scheduleVersion}}",
  "date": "2026-11-09",
  "confirmationToken": "{{confirmationToken}}",
  "exception": {
    "mode": "Weekly",
    "reason": "",
    "intervals": [],
    "slots": [{ "start": "09:00", "mode": "Closed" }]
  }
}

### Free inspection slots for a Kyiv calendar date (authenticated cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inspection-slots?date=2026-11-16

### Create an inspection for the signed-in account (use a future UTC slot from GET /api/inspection-slots).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "inspectionStartUtc": "{{inspectionStartUtc}}",
  "vin": "{{testVin}}",
  "make": "{{testMake}}",
  "model": "{{testModel}}",
  "problemDescription": "{{testProblemDescription}}"
}

### Current account's appointments; category is optional: active, completed, cancelled.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/my?category=active

### Appointment details: owner or Admin+ (use an existing ID).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}

### Absent or inaccessible appointment.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Cancel your own future inspection (authentication and antiforgery required).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/cancel
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

### Administrative inspections for a Kyiv date (Admin/SuperAdmin cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/inspection-calendar?date=2099-01-15

### Preview a weekly schedule change; refresh the antiforgery token first.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/inspection-schedule/preview
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "version": "{{scheduleVersion}}",
  "intervals": [{ "dayOfWeek": "Monday", "start": "09:00", "end": "12:00" }]
}

### Preview a date exception; pass the returned confirmationToken with the same proposal to PUT.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/inspection-exceptions/preview
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "version": "{{scheduleVersion}}",
  "date": "2026-11-09",
  "exception": { "mode": "Weekly", "reason": "", "intervals": [], "slots": [{ "start": "09:00", "mode": "Closed" }] }
}

### Employee directory (Admin/SuperAdmin cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/employees

### Create a worker; refresh antiforgery after login.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/employees
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Тестовий працівник",
  "specialization": "Кузовний ремонт",
  "isActive": true
}

### Fetch a directory entry by its returned id.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/employees/{{employeeId}}

### Deactivate without deleting; use the latest version from a directory response.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/employees/{{employeeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
RequestVerificationToken: {{xsrfToken}}

{
  "version": {{employeeVersion}},
  "isActive": false
}
